1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:00,965
You're eating ice cream

2
00:00:00,965 --> 00:00:01,885
at a sad movie

3
00:00:01,885 --> 00:00:02,702
and your eyes

4
00:00:02,702 --> 00:00:04,200
spring a leak!

5
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,170
Relax,

6
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:05,932
scientists think

7
00:00:05,932 --> 00:00:06,444
your face

8
00:00:06,444 --> 00:00:08,000
just called for backup.

9
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:09,290
Big feelings

10
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:09,985
trip an alarm

11
00:00:09,985 --> 00:00:10,995
in your brain,

12
00:00:10,995 --> 00:00:11,595
and it opens

13
00:00:11,595 --> 00:00:12,128
a tap

14
00:00:12,128 --> 00:00:13,633
above each eye.

15
00:00:13,671 --> 00:00:14,596
The tiny drain

16
00:00:14,596 --> 00:00:15,770
in each eye

17
00:00:15,770 --> 00:00:17,529
leads to your nose...

18
00:00:17,529 --> 00:00:18,343
so your nose

19
00:00:18,343 --> 00:00:19,367
cries too.

20
00:00:20,332 --> 00:00:20,797
The rest

21
00:00:20,797 --> 00:00:22,504
pours down your face,

22
00:00:22,504 --> 00:00:23,317
where everyone

23
00:00:23,317 --> 00:00:24,467
can see it.

24
00:00:24,497 --> 00:00:25,650
It works.

25
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:26,414
Erase the tears

26
00:00:26,414 --> 00:00:27,202
from a photo,

27
00:00:27,202 --> 00:00:28,190
and people see

28
00:00:28,190 --> 00:00:29,620
less sadness...

29
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:30,496
and feel less

30
00:00:30,496 --> 00:00:31,833
like helping.

31
00:00:32,099 --> 00:00:33,199
As far as we know,

32
00:00:33,199 --> 00:00:34,691
you're the only animal

33
00:00:34,691 --> 00:00:35,523
that cries

34
00:00:35,523 --> 00:00:37,239
from feelings.

35
00:00:37,459 --> 00:00:38,387
And a good cry

36
00:00:38,387 --> 00:00:40,200
seems to help most...

37
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:40,917
when backup

38
00:00:40,917 --> 00:00:41,887
shows up.

39
00:00:42,890 --> 00:00:44,210
Some backup.

